{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jxpJ0GoXAT1793703109.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受寒潮影響，內地北方近日氣溫顯著下降，部分地區開始下雪。氣象部門預料，在有紀錄以來最強厄爾尼諾下，今個冬天冷暖變化大。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.WEATHER-1830-1_CLEAN_20261103_184204.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CPyWZw70Xl1793707630.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.WEATHER-1830-1_CLEAN_20261103_184204_006.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FJdcFsOYXl1793706392.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>有中國最冷小鎮之稱的黑龍江大興安嶺呼中區，踏入十一月，已變成「白色世界」，最低氣溫跌至零下28度，呼瑪河兩岸出現霧淞景觀，岸邊的樹木披上白色的冰粒。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.WEATHER-1830-1_CLEAN_20261103_184204_007.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026E15JddPJcH1793706420.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.WEATHER-1830-1_CLEAN_20261103_184204_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BF9c8EBycr1793703645.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>黑龍江省會哈爾濱周二出現入秋以來第一場雪，意味當地雪季即將開始，有小朋友把握機會玩雪，工作人員則忙於清理路面積雪。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.WEATHER-1830-1_CLEAN_20261103_184204_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yh9wy5JFq31793703617.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.WEATHER-1830-1_CLEAN_20261103_184204_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202645U4JNejPF1793703694.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>中國氣象局預測，今個月全國有四次冷空氣過程，局部地區氣溫跌幅逾十度。而有紀錄以來最強厄爾尼諾已在早前形成，國家氣候中心表示，對中國接下來的冬季及春季有明顯影響。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.WEATHER-1830-1_CLEAN_20261103_184204_009.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IJmJzhajso1793706640.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>國家氣候中心副主任高榮說：「預計2026年到2027年冬季，全國氣溫總體偏高，但寒潮頻次略偏多，氣溫冷暖起伏大，北方強降溫降雪，南方階段性低溫雨雪，冰凍風險突出。」</p><p></p><p>當局又預測，今個冬天除了內蒙古東北部、東北地區西部等地氣溫偏低外，全國其餘地區氣溫較往年同期相若或偏高，並且呈現冬天前段冷、後期暖的特點。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:42:19.963806+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":426,"images":8,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T03:58:25.745104+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T12:38:30.347933+00:00","content_hash":"5a8e17ddf829cdaee3eb026230edd263560671d3a2850699b3400f61c91de85c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:42:19.963806+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}